#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "A privacy-first alternative to reCAPTCHA: captchaapi.eu stops form spam without making your visitors click traffic lights. A free tier with commercial use allowed gets you started. The work happens in the background: the visitor's browser solves a small proof-of-work puzzle while they fill in the form, and a token rides along with the submission. There is nothing to solve and nothing to see."
msgstr ""

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Protects WooCommerce (login, registration, lost password, checkout), Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms, Formidable Forms, Forminator, Gravity Forms and Elementor Forms - cookieless, EU-hosted, no cookie banner required."
msgstr ""

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "WooCommerce, WPForms, Fluent Forms, Formidable Forms, Forminator, Gravity Forms, and Elementor Forms, in addition to Contact Form 7. Enable each from the settings screen; the option appears only when that plugin is active. The plugin attaches a token before the form is sent and verifies it on the server."
msgstr ""

